{"id":"vod_lz_117228","vodId":"117228","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"在下坂本，有何贵干？国语","name_cn":"在下坂本，有何贵干？国语","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20251114-1/626acfdc8a81faca5847005b174357c1.jpg"},"summary":"县立学文高中一年级2班，那里有位刚一入学就得到全校注目的男子，他的名字叫坂本（绿川光 配音）。他戴着黑边框眼镜，个人特征是左眼下的泪痣。他不但相貌英俊，着装整齐，而且眼神凌厉，一举一动都华丽潇洒，帅气爆表，因此总能成为众人的焦点，受到女生们的疯狂追捧，但是也因此引起不少同龄男生的嫉妒，包括同班同学阿酱（杉田智和 配音），以及高二级学长8823（游佐浩二 配音）。对面男生们花样百出的陷害和报复，坂本总能帅气满分地完美解决这些麻烦，让男生们甘拜下风。 \r\n 本剧改编自日本漫画家佐野菜见原作的同名漫画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-11-20 02:35:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149550_0eb81bff/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149549_f2dffa5f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149551_81d922c9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149554_6e016189/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149552_3bcc599f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149553_30852a7a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149555_33207f0a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149557_cdd82581/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149558_71b32d0b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149556_638c8d80/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149559_b43417b8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149561_f06605ba/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.cdnlz30.com/20251119/149560_0e0e79ca/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:36.958Z"}